mage-spell-flash-cook-name = Flash Cook
mage-spell-flash-cook-description = Instantly raises the temperature inside food.

mage-spell-taste-of-fire-name = Taste of Fire
mage-spell-taste-of-fire-description = Adds a fiery dint to cuisine. May cause indigestion or inebriation.

mage-spell-spring-bloom-name = Spring Bloom
mage-spell-spring-bloom-description = Brings about a bountiful harvest.

mage-spell-walk-between-worlds-name = Walk Between Worlds
mage-spell-walk-between-worlds-description = Step aside from the physical world, allowing you to walk through walls and other obstacles for a short time.

mage-spell-counterspell-name = Counterspell
mage-spell-counterspell-description = Prevents the target from casting any spells for a short while, and breaks the strings animating any nearby objects.

mage-spell-comet-name = The Comet of the Prophet
mage-spell-comet-description = When meteors just aren't enough.

mage-spell-chain-lightning-name = Chain Lightning
mage-spell-chain-lightning-description = Not a tesloose.

mage-spell-premonition-name = Premonition
mage-spell-premonition-description = Blocks the next 200 damage.

mage-spell-lightning-bolt-name = Uranon's Thunder Bolt
mage-spell-lightning-bolt-description = Puts the fear of the Gods into a target.

mage-spell-greater-premonition-name = Greater Premonition
mage-spell-greater-premonition-description = Blocks damage for the next ten seconds.

mage-spell-finding-divination-name = Finding Divination
mage-spell-finding-divination-description = Points you toward the nearest wielder of tainted magic.

mage-spell-petrify-name = Petrify
mage-spell-petrify-description = Prevents squirming.

mage-spell-word-of-pain-name = Word of Pain
mage-spell-word-of-pain-description = Wracks those around you with stunning pain for several seconds.

mage-spell-doombolt-name = Doombolt
mage-spell-doombolt-description = Corrupts the flesh.

mage-spell-soul-stealer-name = Soulstealer
mage-spell-soul-stealer-description = Their good health is your windfall.

mage-spell-lure-of-chaos-name = Lure of Chaos
mage-spell-lure-of-chaos-description = The only thing holding one back from becoming an antagonist is the self.

mage-spell-summon-daemon-pack-name = Summon Daemon Pack
mage-spell-summon-daemon-pack-description = Brings forth a handful of vile creatures. Do not get close.

mage-spell-cauterize-name = Cauterize
mage-spell-cauterize-description = Mends most non-burn damage, at the cost of a small amount of burning.

mage-spell-conflagration-name = Conflagration of Doom
mage-spell-conflagration-description = An area denial spell of great power.

mage-spell-fiery-blast-name = Fiery Blast
mage-spell-fiery-blast-description = Jets of flame leap forth from your fingers toward a foe.

mage-spell-flaming-sword-name = Flaming Sword
mage-spell-flaming-sword-description = Lettest them taste of thy wroth.

mage-spell-aegis-name = Aegis
mage-spell-aegis-description = A shield of flame to deflect your foes' missiles.

mage-spell-boiling-blood-name = Boiling Blood
mage-spell-boiling-blood-description = Burn their veins, so that are crippled by suffering.

mage-spell-master-of-stone-name = Master of Stone
mage-spell-master-of-stone-description = Brings forth a number of rocks to hurl at your enemies.

mage-spell-flesh-of-clay-name = Flesh of Clay
mage-spell-flesh-of-clay-description = Hardens your body against all but the worst assaults.

mage-spell-father-of-thorns-name = Father of Thorns
mage-spell-father-of-thorns-description = Raises a patch of dangerous brambles.

mage-spell-treefriend-name = Treefriend
mage-spell-treefriend-description = Awakens a non-sentient plant.

mage-spell-earth-blood-name = Earthblood
mage-spell-earth-blood-description = Siphons natural energies to restore health to yourself or another.

mage-spell-maltese-falcon-name = Malda Ondo
mage-spell-maltese-falcon-description = Creates a valuable trinket suitable for barter or bribery.

mage-spell-curse-of-rust-name = Curse of Rust
mage-spell-curse-of-rust-description = Degrades a metal weapon beyond all repair.

mage-spell-enchant-item-name = Enchant Item
mage-spell-enchant-item-description = Converts a weapon into an empowered magical equivalent.

mage-spell-silver-arrows-name = Silver Arrows
mage-spell-silver-arrows-description = Slings a series of sharp metal projectiles toward a foe.

mage-spell-final-transmutation-name = Final Transmutation
mage-spell-final-transmutation-description = Gradually turns a target into a golden statue over a long period, necessitating radical intervention.

mage-spell-enchant-armor-name = Enchant Armor
mage-spell-enchant-armor-description = Transfigures a hardsuit or vest into a superior piece of equipment.

mage-spell-apotheosis-name = Apotheosis
mage-spell-apotheosis-description = Heals and revives in a large area of effect.

mage-spell-soul-quench-name = Soul Quench
mage-spell-soul-quench-description = Extinguishes the essence of an unwanted being.

mage-spell-unmaking-name = Great Unforging
mage-spell-unmaking-description = Rids a target of all equipment.

mage-spell-restoration-name = Verdant Restoration
mage-spell-restoration-description = Floods the station with lush wilderness.

mage-spell-skeletonize-name = Ascent from Flesh
mage-spell-skeletonize-description = Raises a Wight from a body, to serve as your Lieutenant.

mage-spell-invocation-name = Invocation
mage-spell-invocation-description = Heals any nearby Undead Servants.

mage-spell-raise-servant-name = Raise Servant
mage-spell-raise-servant-description = Converts a nearby corpse into an Undead Servant. (Undead Servants are identical to Romerol zombies, but are not contagious. Exploit this fact.)

mage-spell-danse-macabre-name = Danse Macabre
mage-spell-danse-macabre-description = Bestows a blessing of haste upon your Undead minions.

mage-spell-hand-of-dust-name = Hand of Dust
mage-spell-hand-of-dust-description = Your touch disintegrates some of a target's flesh, or turns a corpse to ash.

mage-spell-gaze-name = Gaze of the Great Necromancer
mage-spell-gaze-description = Withers the flesh of one upon whom your eyesight falls.

mage-gear-powerstone-name = Warpstone
mage-gear-powerstone-description = A large chunk of radioactive magical slag in a glass carrying case. Permits the casting of non-Lesser spells. Handle with care.

mage-gear-powerstone-red-name = Aqshy Powerstone
mage-gear-powerstone-red-description = The pure essence of fire, frozen as a strange amorphous crystal. Permits the casting of Red Magic. Handle with care. Caution -- hot!

mage-gear-powerstone-blue-name = Azyr Powerstone
mage-gear-powerstone-blue-description = The pure essence of nature, frozen as a strange amorphous crystal. Permits the casting of Green Magic. Handle with care.

mage-gear-powerstone-gold-name = Chamon Powerstone
mage-gear-powerstone-gold-description = The pure essence of alchemy, frozen as a strange amorphous crystal. Permits the casting of Gold Magic. Handle with care.

mage-gear-powerstone-green-name = Ghyran Powerstone
mage-gear-powerstone-green-description = The pure essence of life, frozen as a strange amorphous crystal. Permits the casting of Green Magic. Handle with care.

mage-gear-powerstone-purple-name = Shyish Powerstone
mage-gear-powerstone-purple-description = The pure essence of death, frozen as a strange amorphous crystal. Permits the casting of Necromancy. Handle with care.
